            variable: "horselord_name",
            value: "$STORE_UNIT_VAR_store.name",
            mode: "value",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:store_unit",
            variable: "STORE_UNIT_VAR_store",
            kill: "no",
            id: "$horselord_id",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:set_variable_dynamic",
            variable: "horselord_name",
            value: "$STORE_UNIT_VAR_store.name",
            mode: "value",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:store_unit",
            variable: "MODIFY_UNIT_store",
            kill: "yes",
            id: "$horselord_id",
          },
          {
            tag: "foreach",
            variable: "MODIFY_UNIT_store",
            item: "this_item",
            children: [
              {
                tag: "hook",
                name: "command:set_variable_dynamic",
                variable: "this_item.facing",
                value: "sw",
                mode: "value",
              },
              {
                tag: "hook",
                name: "command:unstore_unit",
                variable: "this_item",
              },
            ],
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:store_unit",
            variable: "STORE_UNIT_VAR_store",
            kill: "no",
            id: "$companion_id",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:set_variable_dynamic",
            variable: "companion_name",
            value: "$STORE_UNIT_VAR_store.name",
            mode: "value",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:store_unit",
            variable: "STORE_UNIT_VAR_store",
            kill: "no",
            id: "$companion_id",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:set_variable_dynamic",
            variable: "companion_name",
            value: "$STORE_UNIT_VAR_store.name",
            mode: "value",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:store_unit",
            variable: "MODIFY_UNIT_store",
            kill: "yes",
            id: "$companion_id",
          },
          {
            tag: "foreach",
            variable: "MODIFY_UNIT_store",
            item: "this_item",
            children: [
              {
                tag: "hook",
                name: "command:set_variable_dynamic",
                variable: "this_item.facing",
                value: "sw",
                mode: "value",
              },
              {
                tag: "hook",
                name: "command:unstore_unit",
                variable: "this_item",
              },
            ],
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:delay",
            time: 500,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:scroll_to",
            x: 1,
            y: 6,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:delay",
            time: 500,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:scroll_to",
            x: 25,
            y: 19,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:delay",
            time: 500,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:scroll_to",
            x: 59,
            y: 20,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:delay",
            time: 500,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:scroll_to",
            x: 44,
            y: 4,
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Methor",
            text: _("Look at the length of that column! The prince — the king, I suppose — must have picked up more soldiers at Dan’Tonk, when he forced the magistrate to swear fealty. Your seeker spell was excellent, Delfador; we’ve been able to find and intercept Eldred before he could turn anyone else to his cause."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "$companion_id",
            text: _("Boss, how’s we supposed to fight that many!? Even if we could, what about Queen Asheviere back in Weldyn?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "$horselord_id",
            text: _("Indeed! Word is she’s killed half of the court and paid off the rest; the remaining lords of the city are loyal only to her! Eldred may be king, but Asheviere holds the reins."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Delfador",
            text: _("We don’t have to fight the entire army or deal with Weldyn. The capital is too well-defended for us to sack outright — Eldred is the objective here."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Delfador",
            text: _("Once the truth gets out about Garard’s death, we’ll have enough allies to liberate Weldyn and more besides. But only if we can stop Eldred here and now — can prove to the watchers that this coup is not yet over; that justice and honor and hope still live in Wesnoth! That’s our goal today."),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:delay",
            time: 500,
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "$companion_id",
            text: _(""),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Eldred",
            text: _("Delfador, welcome! I was wondering if we’d get an appearance from you old has-been! ’fraid you’re not as popular with Mother and me as you were with old Garard."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Eldred",
            text: _("Opposing me is hopeless, old mage. But it’s not too late to save yourself — surrender now, disband your little rebel rabble, and we can tell the men it was all a big misunderstanding."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Eldred",
            text: _("Just lay down your staff and greet me with open arms. You can even have your old title back! “Delfador the Great”, High Advisor to the Crown — don’t you agree that has a nice ring to it?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Delfador",
            text: _("I am no longer so foolish as to be tempted by <b><i>that</i></b>, young prince! Enough blood has been spilled on your behalf; stop this madness and give up the throne, or I shall make you."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Eldred",
            text: _("Oh no, I don’t think so. You forget you’re speaking to your king, old man. Soldiers, attack! ATTACK!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:teleport",
            id: "Delfador",
            x: 49,
            y: 2,
            to_x: 48,
            to_y: 1,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:store_unit",
            variable: "MODIFY_UNIT_store",
            kill: "yes",
            id: "Delfador",
          },
          {
            tag: "foreach",
            variable: "MODIFY_UNIT_store",
            item: "this_item",
            children: [
              {
                tag: "hook",
                name: "command:set_variable_dynamic",
                variable: "this_item.facing",
                value: "sw",
                mode: "value",
              },
              {
                tag: "hook",
                name: "command:unstore_unit",
                variable: "this_item",
              },
            ],
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_78",
        on: "turn",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "condition",
            variable: "turn_number",
            equals: 4,
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Delfador",
            text: _("Eldred, you know full well that your father and I were close! Is this what he would have wanted? His kingdom turned against itself, his townships pillaged by orcs? He had hope; a future for Wesnoth! A future for you!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Eldred",
            text: _("A future for me? I can count on one hand the times the old tyrant had anything kind to say about me."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Eldred",
            text: _("I wasn’t going to wait around to be disinherited, or worse. It was always going to be him or me — I just beat him to the finish."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Delfador",
            text: _("Fool. I will not bandy words with whatever madness has taken root inside your mind, Eldred. Garard was harsh; I cannot deny that. But you’re a fool if you think he ever felt anything but love for you."),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_79",
        on: "side_turn_end",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "condition",
            variable: "turn_side",
            equals: 1,
          },
          {
            tag: "condition",
            variable: "turn_number",
            equals: 4,
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Eldred",
            text: _("I’m no fool, Delfador. Day and night, my parents fought. Whether said in truth or in anger, there are some things my father can never take back."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Eldred",
            text: _("And don’t think that I have any illusions about what sort of snake Mother is either. I know, believe me. But she’s the snake who’s made me king, and that’s good enough."),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_80",
        on: "turn",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "condition",
            variable: "turn_number",
            equals: 7,
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Eldred",
            text: _("This wasn’t the first time Mother’s gone after Garard, you know. In the early days of the war, she betrayed his plans to the Whitefangs; fled to the orcs while they surrounded you and him both."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Eldred",
            text: _("You and Deoran brought her back, of course, and Lionel fought Garard free of the orcs. My childhood would have been so different if things had succeeded..."),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_81",
        on: "turn",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "condition",
            variable: "turn_number",
            equals: 10,
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Eldred",
            text: _("I’m surprised you haven’t given up yet, wizard! But you’re no stranger to hopeless fights, are you — you bested Malal, escaped the frozen north, scattered our saurians."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Eldred",
            text: _("Malal was clever; <i>really</i> clever, and determined too. No-one but Mother knows what Garard did to earn Malal’s ire, but the two of them would stop at nothing to see Garard dead and his reputation destroyed. Tricking the saurians and orcs into working together, getting Lionel sent away, pitting Garard against Arand..."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Eldred",
            text: _("Delfador, you weren’t supposed to survive Malal. You weren’t supposed to survive <i><b>any</b></i> of that."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Delfador",
            text: _("Would that more had survived along with me, Eldred. Would that I had listened to Deoran, would that I had understood the seer! Had I been but a little wiser, so many lives might yet have been saved."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Delfador",
            text: _("I can never atone for the lives I cost, but I can yet honor them through my actions. And right now, honoring them means stopping you."),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "on_undo_83",
        on: "on_undo",
        once: false,
      },
      {
