          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Eldred",
            text: _("NO!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Delfador",
            text: _("It’s over, Eldred. Down on your knees, now! The rest of you; get back! BACK, or you’ll have to find yet another king!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Eldred",
            text: _("I didn’t come all this way just to fail now... not at the hand of some cheap conjurer. No, I prepared for this. After my failed attack on Arand, I took... precautions."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Eldred",
            text: _("They say this elixir came all the way from the Old Continent, Delfador. Persuading Malal to give it up wasn’t easy. You like magic so much? Once I drink from Jevyan’s Cup, I’ll have enough magic to turn you all to dust!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Delfador",
            text: _("Is that— are you holding <i>lich’s blood</i>!? How— Put it down, Eldred!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Delfador",
            text: _("Whatever you do, don’t you dare drink it! We have no idea what will happen! Don’t you dare, Eldred! ELDRED!"),
          },
          {
