          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            portrait: "wesnoth-icon.png",
            text: _("Thus perishes Eldred, thirteenth king of Wesnoth. With him ends the story of the sons of Haldric; that unbroken line of kings stretching five hundred years back to the Green Isle itself."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            portrait: "wesnoth-icon.png",
            text: _("The exhausted Delfador fights valiantly against Eldred’s — now Asheviere’s — army, but reinforcements from Weldyn eventually repulse the beleaguered rebels. Neither side wins a decisive military victory."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            portrait: "wesnoth-icon.png",
            text: _("As word spreads of the kings’ deaths, a terrible foreboding seems to settle over the Wesnothian countryside."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            portrait: "wesnoth-icon.png",
            text: _("After all, the civil war has only just begun..."),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:volume",
            music: 100,
          },
          {
            tag: "win",
          },
